# DNS dataset: only the bundled "light" stateless CSVs (dataset/dns/) are
# tracked for reproducible training of the small demo model. Heavier
# variants, the stateful/*.csv files (not used for training -- see
# dns/FEATURE_MAPPING.md), and any raw packet captures are left for the
# user to add locally and are not committed.
dataset/dns/**/stateless_features-heavy_*.csv
dataset/dns/**/stateful_features-*.csv
*.pcap
*.pcapng
# Generated attack-test logs/scratch artifacts
/attack_logs/
/tmp_attack_runs/
